WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.756
Spark SQL and the DataFrame API are closely related
SQL

00:00:05.782 --> 00:00:11.877
expresses the logic with SQL syntax The DataFrame
API expresses transformations

00:00:11.903 --> 00:00:19.154
through code Both can use Spark's structured
execution engine For

00:00:19.181 --> 00:00:24.931
students who already know SQL Spark SQL is a natural
entry point into distributed processing
